<title>NETHERLANDS: GILISSEN RAISES KLM EPS, MAINTAINS HOLD.</title>
<headline>GILISSEN RAISES KLM EPS, MAINTAINS HOLD.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Research note summary (08/08)</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    KLM		 Airlines	79.20   Theodoor Gilissen</p>
<p>COMMENT: Q1 results exceeded expectations. Lower interest charges and increased profits on holdings makes 14 pct ROE feasible. We raise 98, 99 EPS. Including book profits, EPS are NLG 12.70 (98) and 11.00 (99). We maintain HOLD recommendation.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):   EPS    pvs EPS   P/E</p>
<p>    1996/97 (actual)   3.01   ----	26.3</p>
<p>    1997/98		7.25   5.05	10.9</p>
<p>    1998/99		6.40   5.30	12.4</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
